// Reference for slow measure 1 on its table shape, not a like-for-like comparison: the plain Outturn over the same two
// columns as ../as_at_release_by_department.dax. It has 1,842 non-blank cells where the as-at grid has 1,931, because a
// delta exists only in the release that made it.
EVALUATE
SUMMARIZECOLUMNS (
    'Release'[Release Label],
    'Department (current structure)'[Department Number],
    "outturn", [Outturn]
)
ORDER BY 'Release'[Release Label], 'Department (current structure)'[Department Number]
